 "section_summary": "This section contains the introductory text, statistical tables, and detailed school roster for Nara Prefecture from a 1946 comprehensive survey of Japanese educational institutions compiled by the SCAP Civil Information and Education Section in cooperation with the Japanese Ministry of Education. The opening pages describe the three tiers of administrative control (national, public, and private) and provide an overall schema of Japan's educational system. Twelve detailed statistical tables present institutional counts, student enrollment by gender, and faculty numbers across higher, secondary, elementary, and special education as of April 30 and November 30, 1946. The roster catalogues individual institutions across the prefecture, recording their locations, founding dates, student bodies, and teaching personnel.",
