   "summary": "This document contains the introductory overview, summary statistical tables, and individual school listings for Nara Prefecture from a 1946 census of Japanese educational institutions compiled by the SCAP Civil Information and Education Section in cooperation with the Japanese Ministry of Education. The introductory text outlines the structure of educational administration, defining national, prefectural, municipal, and town or village control across all levels of schooling. A set of twelve statistical tables provides institutional totals, enrollment figures by gender, and counts of full-time and part-time teachers as of April 30 and November 30, 1946. The roster lists individual institutions throughout the prefecture, specifying their administrative jurisdiction, address, date of founding, student enrollment, and faculty numbers.",
